From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] msvcp: time_get<unsigned short> and time_base.

time_get<unsigned short, istreambuf_iterator<unsigned short>> was a spec
stub in msvcp70..msvcp140: it is now the wchar_t facet with its own id,
vtable and RTTI (constructors, _Getcat), the other members shared, and
time_base (its constructors, destructor and vtable) is exported. msvcp_win
and msvcp120_app forward the new entries, and the msvcp140/msvcp120
functions they lacked (_Throw_Cpp_error, _Cosh/_Sinh variants, time_base's
vtable).
